When *_someone or something turns their back to you_*, you feel an urge to hunt them.

When *_someone or something flees from you_*, you feel an almost irresistible urge to give in to your predatory instinct.


When you *_Seek Insight_*, you may always ask 'who or what here is the easiest prey?' or 'how is \_\_\_ weak or vulnerable?', but take disadvantage on doing anything except giving into your predatory instinct and immediately acting upon the answer.

When you *_give in to your predatory instinct_*, your instinct temporarily becomes 'Predation: To hunt and prey on those lesser than you.'

When you *_complete your hunt and take down your prey_*, say what part of them you take as a trophy, and integrate it into yourself, physically or spiritually.
Mark an existing improvement or write your own below.
When you reach six improvements, your transformation into a *Zrajedak* is complete.

